      value: "Your kids\u2019 names are Bella and Sydney. Bella is 12. Sydney is
        2. \r\nBella doesn\u2019t like milk or vegetables. Sydney is still having
        a hard time with solid foods. (Her yogurt is on the top shelf of the fridge
        because she keeps getting into there somehow. DO NOT LET HER HAVE IT WHENEVER
        SHE WANTS!!!)\r\nBrigette is dead. You haven\u2019t forgotten that part yet,
        but the girls will get sad if you"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
